SSR islands for SvelteKit, no Kit patches. Your pages are plain HTML, and nothing hydrates until you say so: mark a component with `wake: 'load'` (or on scroll, or any cue you pick) and only that ships JavaScript. Comes with content, image and a whole family of helper packages.
